WEBVTT

00:09:28.583 --> 00:09:32.209
Nas gol za robotiku je
da otkljuca mentalnu snagu svih nas

00:09:32.209 --> 00:09:34.878
cineci svijet fizicki dostupnim

00:09:34.878 --> 00:09:37.421
ljudima poput mene i drugih slicnih meni

00:09:37.421 --> 00:09:39.603
sirom svijeta.

00:09:39.603 --> 00:09:41.486
Uz pomoc ljudi poput vas,

00:09:41.486 --> 00:09:44.626
ovaj san moze postati stvarnost.

00:09:44.626 --> 00:09:47.307
Hvala.

00:09:47.307 --> 00:09:54.236
(Aplauz)